  "equipment_type": "VRF / split AC gateway",
  "applies_to": "MelcoBEMS MINI (A1M+) on the CN105 connector of a Mitsubishi Electric Air-To-Air indoor unit (M series MSZ/MFZ/MLZ, S series SEZ/SLZ, P series per Appendix A), installation manual v1.0.3, firmware 4.1.1.",
  "summary": "Small Procon protocol converter that plugs into the CN105 connector of one Mitsubishi Electric split indoor unit and serves Modbus RTU (RS-485) or Modbus TCP. For air-to-air units it exposes mode, setpoint, fan, vane and on/off, room temperature and fault code, plus a BMS room-sensor offset feature and an optional deadband auto-changeover.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU",
    "TCP"
  ],
